# Table List Display (List)

## Empty state
- Empty text: `No matching records found.`
- This message must be shown for both cases:
  - No data exists.
  - Search has no results.

## Pagination
- Options: `10`, `25`, `50`, `100`
- Default: `25`

## Column width & long text
- Columns must use fixed width.
- If text is too long:
  - Display `...` (ellipsis) instead of wrapping.
  - On hover, show a tooltip with the full content.

## Row click behavior
- Do NOT enable opening detail by clicking a table row.
- There is already a dedicated `detail` button, so row click must not trigger navigation/detail opening.
